# Manuscript sources are versioned here (user 2026-10-28). The repo-wide *.png ignore is lifted
# for this folder because figure thumbnails and templates are part of the source.
!*.png
!*.PNG
# build products: rebuild with ./build.sh; dated snapshots go to drafts/
/build/
latex/root.pdf
*-eps-converted-to.pdf
# repo-wide *.json ignore is lifted: figure sidecars record input files + md5
!*.json
# note: a folder named data/ is ignored repo-wide, so figure numbers live in figures/source_data/
